<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <TargetFrameworks>netstandard2.0;net8.0;net10.0</TargetFrameworks>
    <TreatWarningsAsErrors>true</TreatWarningsAsErrors>
    <IsTrimmable Condition="$([MSBuild]::IsTargetFrameworkCompatible('$(TargetFramework)', 'net6.0'))">true</IsTrimmable>
    <GenerateDocumentationFile>true</GenerateDocumentationFile>
    <RepositoryBranch>master</RepositoryBranch>
    <IncludeSymbols>true</IncludeSymbols>
    <SymbolPackageFormat>snupkg</SymbolPackageFormat>

    <Version>4.8.0</Version>

    <Description>NLog BlobStorageTarget for writing to Azure Cloud Blob Storage</Description>
    <Authors>jdetmar</Authors>
    <Copyright>Copyright (c) 2017 - jdetmar</Copyright>

    <PackageTags>NLog;azure;CloudBlob;blob;storage;log;logging</PackageTags>
    <PackageIcon>logo64.png</PackageIcon>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
    <PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/JDetmar/NLog.Extensions.AzureStorage</PackageProjectUrl>
    <RepositoryType>git</RepositoryType>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/JDetmar/NLog.Extensions.AzureStorage.git</RepositoryUrl>
    <PackageLicenseExpression>MIT</PackageLicenseExpression>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>
- Metadata and tags are now rendered from the first log event written to a new blob, so event-based layouts like ${event-properties} work (#212)
- Changed: a tag that renders empty is now skipped unless includeEmptyValue="true" (previously sent as an empty value) (#212)
- Fixed whole-batch loss when a rendered tag or metadata value breaks Azure's rules: invalid characters are replaced with '_', metadata values are trimmed and tag values truncated to 256 chars (#214, #215)
- Fixed whole-batch loss when Azure rejects metadata or tags (invalid name, more than 10 tags, 8 KB metadata limit, SAS without tag permission): the blob is now created without them and an error is logged (#214)

Docs: https://github.com/JDetmar/NLog.Extensions.AzureStorage/blob/master/src/NLog.Extensions.AzureBlobStorage/README.md
    </PackageReleaseNotes>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="../../logo64.png" Link="logo64.png" Pack="true" PackagePath="" Visible="false" />
    <None Include="README.md" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <Compile Include="..\NLog.Extensions.AzureStorage\AzureCredentialHelper.cs" Link="AzureCredentialHelper.cs" />
    <Compile Include="..\NLog.Extensions.AzureStorage\AzureStorageNameCache.cs" Link="AzureStorageNameCache.cs" />
    <Compile Include="..\NLog.Extensions.AzureStorage\ProxyHelpers.cs" Link="ProxyHelpers.cs" />
    <Compile Include="..\NLog.Extensions.AzureStorage\SortHelpers.cs" Link="SortHelpers.cs" />
    <Compile Include="..\NLog.Extensions.AzureStorage\StoragePropertyHelpers.cs" Link="StoragePropertyHelpers.cs" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageReference Include="Azure.Storage.Blobs" Version="12.24.1" />
    <PackageReference Include="Azure.Identity" Version="1.17.1" />
    <PackageReference Include="NLog" Version="5.2.5" />
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
